{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方两行超大号白字与紫色强调词，随后容易被下方同样醒目的紫色大字“ 一阵心慌，连往下想都不敢了”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只能初步看出他正在犹豫要不要回去，具体为何舍不得、为何想回去还不够确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、害怕、不敢继续想。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想回去究竟是舍不得曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤单到愿意再次忍受那些委屈；这层两难需要读完主标题才能理解。中间小字还描述了重新遇见过去的自己以及问题仍没有答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题虽然字号很大，但两行长句包含两种不同的回去动机，需要读完整句才能辨认两难关系。\",\n    \"核心处境在上方主标题，明确的情绪结果在下方另一块大字中，需要跨块对应“这念头”才能理解处境与感受的关系。\",\n    \"中间小字连续堆叠，包含多个叙事层次，容易分散注意力。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5d16a75-5db4-40c5-acae-03598cc51c00", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013101600949Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:31:35.810591+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cbe46bbff6c9c7478c06d823a39527e777c9e53d2ce414ea71deb5e000d51cae", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8e